    <string name="privacy">Privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">WaveDeck processes music, playlists, listening history and settings locally. No account, analytics, telemetry, internet permission or cloud service. Audio permission reads MediaStore; the document picker grants access only to selected lyrics and playlists. Playback uses a foreground media service and a wake lock. App data is excluded from Android backup. Uninstalling removes the local database and preferences; audio stays on your device.</string>
    <string name="limitations">Glass uses layered tint and blurred artwork on Android 12+. Earlier devices use translucent surfaces. This is an original WaveDeck design. Audio support depends on Android codecs. DSP, crossfade and live spectrum are not enabled in this build.</string>
